xt","value":"，反馈线圈电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R=0.5\\,\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，线圈内圈半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r_1=r"},{"type":"text","value":"，外圈半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r_2=2r"},{"type":"text","value":"，已知"},{"type":"math","value":"k=0.1\\,\\mathrm{T/A}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega=30\\,\\mathrm{rad/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac1\\pi\\,\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi"},{"type":"text","value":"取3。\n（1）若激励线圈接"},{"type":"math","value":"I=1\\,\\mathrm A"},{"type":"text","value":"的恒定电流，磁场方向如图乙所示，反馈线圈逆时针转动过程中，\n①比较图乙时刻"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"两点电势高低；\n②求线圈所产生的电流大小。\n（2）若反馈线圈不转动，模拟血栓块恰好与其中一叶片重叠，当激励线圈接"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\sin30t\\,\\mathrm{(A)}"},{"type":"text","value":"的交流电时，磁场方向相应改变，求反馈线圈所产生的感应电动势的有效值。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1a838b6ba453ac9f1ad7ada139d41e4e81834e6449949c143f385a067c3691ec.png","width":1060,"height":382,"width_mm":136.983,"row_group":"jinhua-2604-q16-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"（1）① B 电势高于 A"},{"type":"score","value":"（2 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n② 反馈线圈产生的电动势为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_1=\\frac12 B_0\\omega(r_2^2-r_1^2)"},{"type":"score","value":"（2 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"E_1=0.5\\mathrm V"},{"type":"score","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"I_1=\\frac{E_1}{R}=1\\mathrm A"},{"type":"score","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）反馈线圈有效磁场面积"},{"type":"math","value":"S=\\frac12\\pi r_1^2+\\frac13\\pi r_2^2=\\frac{11}{18}\\mathrm{m^2}"},{"type":"score","value":"（2 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{S\\cdot\\Delta B}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{11}{6}\\